//       (`tool` / `light` / `detection` / `utility` / `rope` /
//       `scanner` / `gate` / `aetheric`). Refuses consumables /
//       weapons / armor / jewelry / already-pouched / currently-
//       in-off-hand items with Arbiter-friendly reasons.
