// multiRemove — NEVER a live save, .bak, index, active-slot pointer, or the `tartaria.global.v2` stash. Also
// DIAGNOSTIC: tryStage now records WHY it failed (setItem THREW = full DB, vs readback MISMATCH w/ byte
