// catch-all. Tests: __tests__/emergencyReclaim.test.ts. app/engine/saveSystem.ts. JS-only → OTA. NOTE: the
// durable ceiling fix — raising AsyncStorage's 6MB cap via expo-build-properties — needs a NATIVE build.
