// diamond) with a load-time 'fused'-tag backfill on older forges. New fusedItemMarkerAndCategory
// suite (5). JS-only → OTA-safe.
// OTA-674 — fused marker glyph ✶ → ❖ (a diamond OF diamonds; materials wear a single ◆), ported
