// OTA-710 — two more gold sinks (ports Tartaria OTA-728 + OTA-729): (1) PAY-TO-TRAIN — "train <stat>"
// pays TC to raise a stat +1; cost scales with current value (50×) and caps at 15 so it's a sink, not a
